<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div><font face="arial">Hello {!Contact.FirstName},</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Your Financial Aid Notification is now posted on <a href="https://my.asu.edu">My ASU</a> under your <b>Finances</b> tab. Your next step is to act on your awards.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">I encourage you to take advantage of our <a href="https://students.asu.edu/financialaid/budget">Student Budget Worksheet</a> to determine if you want to accept, modify or decline any part of your financial aid package. Creating an annual budget helps you understand your total costs, how your financial aid awards help cover those costs and any remaining balance due to ASU after your aid is applied. When using this budget worksheet, refer to your FAN for a list of your offered awards.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">If you have any questions regarding your FAN, please feel free to contact me or <a href="https://students.asu.edu/contact/financialaid">Financial Aid and Scholarship Services</a>. I am happy to discuss the costs and how to pay for ASU and look forward to the opportunity to speak with you.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
